# Quick start

A first Invoklet script. It prints one line of plain text and then renders a small
collection as a table with `.Dump()`.

Press **Run** (F5) and look at the **Results** tab under the editor.

```csharp run
var languages = new[] { "C#", "Visual Basic" };
Console.WriteLine($"Hello from Invoklet! {languages.Length} languages are supported.");

languages
    .Select((name, index) => new { Position = index + 1, Name = name, Letters = name.Length })
    .Dump("Supported languages");
```

Everything outside the fenced `csharp run` block, including this paragraph, is ordinary
Markdown. Invoklet keeps it unchanged when it saves the file.
